# What Courage Looks Like
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
The hero in this game never stops to eat.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
Perhaps that is why he keeps losing.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
Perhaps someone should tell him that coming home is an achievement.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
Is that your professional advice?
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Yes. From an expert in waiting.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
You set the pieces aside before the candles burn low.
